{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"あばばばば!!ヽ(・∀・)ノ\nな衝撃でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂４６\nオリコンウィークリーチャート"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/6525778/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/6525778/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/6525778/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１位"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/6525778/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/6525778/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/6525778/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん本当にありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だがしかし!!\n乃木坂４６はまだまだまだまだまだまだまだまだまだ......上り坂です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもっと沢山のみなさんの心に届く歌とパフォーマンスが出来るように、前に進んで行きたいです。\nどうか見守って下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/6525778/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ところで...\n話は変わるのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒の住んでいる部屋が\nプチジャンプショップ\nになってきた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナルトのフィギアとか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/08/6525778/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぬら孫のファイルとかかざってるを!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくうれしい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん生駒の話を聞いてくださってありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントも一気に全部は読めないけど、読んでます!!\nみんなさんおもしろい!!\nそして優しい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝しています!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと一言言わせて下さい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一週間待ったかいがあった〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週ジャンプ発売だよ〜\n月曜日に買ったよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週一週間元気はつらつだよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぉおおおおおおおおおぉヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意味不明な感じですいませんでした！"}],"source":"archive"}